#21300
The Stair of Glass~
   Beyond the gate a stair of clear glass climbs into grey nothing. There is
no ground beneath it, no sky above, only a grey haze in every direction.
Each step rings like a bell. When you look down through the glass you see
the realm far below, very small, and darkness spreading east across it.
~
