#21301
The Hall of Reflections~
   A hall of mirrors with no walls, only mirrors, hanging in the grey. Each
mirror shows you, but wrong: older, younger, hollowed, kneeling, dead. In
one you are wearing grey and marching east. The reflections watch you, and
some of them step out of their frames.
~
