#21302
The Garden of Lost Things~
   A garden of grey flowers where everything the West has ever taken lies
scattered: toys, crowns, letters, wedding rings, a child's drawing of a
house. They are not real; they are memories, and they fade when you touch
them. Things that were never made wander among them, collecting.
~
