#21303
Beneath the Broken Sky~
   You stand on a plain of grey dust beneath a sky that has cracked like a
plate. Through the cracks you can see something vast and dark moving, very
far away, like a shape beneath ice. Fragments of the sky fall slowly around
you, and where they land the ground stops existing.
~
