#21305
The Drowning Dark~
   A darkness so complete it feels like water, pressing on your eyes and
filling your mouth. You cannot tell up from down. Voices whisper from every
side, the voices of everyone you have lost, telling you to stop, to rest, to
let go. It would be so easy.
~
