Before the Last Door~
   The darkness ends at a door standing alone in the grey, a plain wooden
door like the door of any farmhouse in the realm. It is the most frightening
thing you have ever seen. Before it stands the Keeper of the Threshold, who
has waited here since before the first kingdom of men.
~
